Common OtherName
    documentation "Other names (e.g., alias, nickname, previous legal name) associated with an individual."
    shared string PersonalTitlePrefix
        documentation "A prefix used to denote the title, degree, position, or seniority of the individual."
        is optional
    shared string FirstName
        documentation "A name given to an individual at birth, baptism, or during another naming ceremony, or through legal change."
        is required
    shared string MiddleName
        documentation "A secondary name given to an individual at birth, baptism, or during another naming ceremony."
        is optional
    shared string LastSurname
        documentation "The name borne in common by members of a family."
        is required
    shared string GenerationCodeSuffix
        documentation "An appendage, if any, used to denote an individual's generation in his family (e.g., Jr., Sr., III)."
        is optional
    descriptor OtherNameType
        documentation "The types of alternate names for an individual."
        is part of identity